#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:747
#. translators: Admin notice explaining how to enable PayPal Advanced Card Payments. HTML <br> tags are intentional for formatting.
msgid ""
"To use Advanced Card Payments, ensure your PayPal account is eligible and "
"enabled:<br><br>\n"
"                <strong>Steps:</strong><br>\n"
"                1. Visit developer.paypal.com → Apps & Credentials → API "
"Credentials.<br>\n"
"                2. Click your App Name.<br>\n"
"                3. Under \"Features\" → Accept Payments, check if "
"\"Advanced Credit and Debit Card Payments\" is enabled.<br>\n"
"                4. If missing, your account or region may not support it."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menggunakan Pembayaran Kad Lanjutan, pastikan akaun PayPal anda layak "
"dan didayakan:<br><br>\n"
"                <strong>Steps:</strong><br>\n"
"                1. Lawati developer.paypal.com → Apl & Bukti Kelayakan → "
"Kredensial API.<br>\n"
"                2. Klik Nama Apl anda.<br>\n"
"                3. Di bawah \"Ciri\" → Terima Pembayaran, semak sama ada "
"\"Pembayaran Kad Kredit dan Debit Lanjutan\" didayakan.<br>\n"
"                4. Jika tiada, akaun atau wilayah anda mungkin tidak "
"menyokongnya."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:824
msgid "Fastlane by PayPal"
msgstr "Fastlane oleh PayPal"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:826
msgid ""
"Fastlane offers an accelerated guest checkout: returning Fastlane members "
"are recognized by their email address, verify with a one-time code and pay "
"with their saved card — no typing, no account needed on your store. New "
"customers can enroll during checkout. Fastlane requires Advanced Card "
"Processing and is currently available to US merchants transacting in USD."
msgstr ""
"Fastlane menawarkan pembayaran tetamu dipercepatkan: ahli Fastlane yang "
"kembali dikenali melalui alamat e-mel mereka, sahkan dengan kod sekali dan "
"bayar dengan kad yang disimpan — tanpa menaip, tiada akaun diperlukan di "
"kedai anda. Pelanggan baharu boleh mendaftar semasa pembayaran. Fastlane "
"memerlukan Pemprosesan Kad Lanjutan dan kini tersedia untuk pedagang AS "
"yang berurus niaga dalam USD."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:830
msgid "Enable Fastlane by PayPal"
msgstr "Dayakan Fastlane melalui PayPal"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:833
msgid ""
"Adds Fastlane accelerated checkout to the Advanced Credit/Debit Card "
"gateway. Shoppers who enter a Fastlane member email address are offered a "
"one-time-code login and can pay with their saved card in a couple of clicks."
msgstr ""
"Menambahkan pembayaran dipercepatkan Fastlane ke pintu masuk Kad "
"Kredit/Debit Lanjutan. Pembeli yang memasukkan alamat e-mel ahli Fastlane "
"ditawarkan log masuk kod sekali dan boleh membayar dengan kad yang disimpan "
"dalam beberapa klik."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:837
msgid "Fastlane Flow"
msgstr "Aliran Fastlane"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:842
msgid "Email Detection"
msgstr "Pengesanan E-mel"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:843
msgid "Express Button"
msgstr "Butang Ekspres"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:845
msgid ""
"Email Detection (recommended by PayPal): Fastlane engages automatically "
"when the customer enters a member email address. Express Button: a Fastlane "
"button is shown in the express checkout section at the top of the checkout "
"page and the customer starts Fastlane by clicking it."
msgstr ""
"Pengesanan E-mel (disyorkan oleh PayPal): Fastlane terlibat secara "
"automatik apabila pelanggan memasukkan alamat e-mel ahli. Butang Ekspres: "
"butang Fastlane ditunjukkan dalam bahagian daftar keluar ekspres di "
"bahagian atas halaman pembayaran dan pelanggan memulakan Fastlane dengan "
"mengkliknya."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:849
msgid "Authenticate On Page Load"
msgstr "Sahkan Pada Muatan Halaman"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:850
msgid "Start Fastlane authentication when the checkout page loads"
msgstr "Mulakan pengesahan Fastlane apabila halaman daftar keluar dimuatkan"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:853
msgid ""
"If the billing email address is already populated when the checkout page "
"loads (for example a logged-in returning customer), start the Fastlane "
"member lookup and one-time-code verification right away instead of waiting "
"for the customer to edit the email field."
msgstr ""
"Jika alamat e-mel pengebilan sudah diisi apabila halaman daftar keluar "
"dimuatkan (contohnya pelanggan yang kembali log masuk), mulakan carian ahli "
"Fastlane dan pengesahan kod sekali dengan segera dan bukannya menunggu "
"pelanggan mengedit medan e-mel."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:857
msgid "Fastlane Watermark"
msgstr "Tera Air Fastlane"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:858
msgid "Show the \"Fastlane by PayPal\" watermark under the email field"
msgstr "Tunjukkan tera air \"Fastlane by PayPal\" di bawah medan e-mel"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:861
msgid ""
"Displays the Fastlane watermark below the billing email field so customers "
"know their email address is checked against Fastlane. Recommended by PayPal."
msgstr ""
"Memaparkan tera air Fastlane di bawah medan e-mel pengebilan supaya "
"pelanggan tahu alamat e-mel mereka disemak terhadap Fastlane. Disyorkan "
"oleh PayPal."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:865
msgid "Email Field At Top"
msgstr "Medan E-mel Di Atas"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:866
msgid "Move the email address field to the top of the billing form"
msgstr "Alihkan medan alamat e-mel ke bahagian atas borang pengebilan"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:869
msgid ""
"Fastlane recognizes customers by their email address, so asking for it "
"first gives returning members the fastest possible checkout. Applies to the "
"classic checkout form; the block checkout already asks for the email "
"address first."
msgstr ""
"Fastlane mengenali pelanggan melalui alamat e-mel mereka, jadi memintanya "
"terlebih dahulu memberikan ahli yang kembali pembayaran terpantas mungkin. "
"Terpakai pada borang pembayaran klasik; checkout blok sudah meminta alamat "
"e-mel terlebih dahulu."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:873
msgid "Fastlane Signup Link"
msgstr "Pautan Pendaftaran Fastlane"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:874
msgid "Show a \"Pay faster with Fastlane\" link to non-members"
msgstr "Tunjukkan pautan \"Bayar lebih pantas dengan Fastlane\" kepada bukan ahli"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:877
msgid ""
"When the entered email address is not a Fastlane member, show a link above "
"the card fields that lets the customer enter their card through Fastlane "
"and join for faster future checkouts."
msgstr ""
"Apabila alamat e-mel yang dimasukkan bukan ahli Fastlane, tunjukkan pautan "
"di atas medan kad yang membolehkan pelanggan memasukkan kad mereka melalui "
"Fastlane dan menyertai untuk pembayaran masa hadapan yang lebih pantas."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1950
msgid "Authorized Order Status"
msgstr "Status Pesanan Dibenarkan"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1953
msgid "If the transaction is authorized, this status will be applied to the order."
msgstr "Jika transaksi dibenarkan, status ini akan digunakan pada pesanan."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1959
msgid "Capture Order Statuses"
msgstr "Tangkap Status Pesanan"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1962
msgid ""
"Authorized payments will be captured when the order moves to one of these "
"statuses."
msgstr ""
"Pembayaran yang dibenarkan akan ditangkap apabila pesanan berpindah ke "
"salah satu status ini."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1966
msgid "Select order statuses"
msgstr "Pilih status pesanan"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2037
msgid "Auto-complete paid orders"
msgstr "Autolengkapkan pesanan berbayar"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2039
msgid "Mark orders as \"Completed\" after successful payment"
msgstr "Tandai pesanan sebagai \"Selesai\" selepas pembayaran berjaya"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2042
msgid ""
"WooCommerce normally sets Processing for physical products. Enable this "
"only if you want all successful orders to become Completed automatically."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce biasanya menetapkan Pemprosesan untuk produk fizikal. Dayakan "
"ini hanya jika anda mahu semua pesanan yang berjaya menjadi Selesai secara "
"automatik."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2056
msgid "API Cache"
msgstr "Cache API"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2058
msgid ""
"Clear all cached PayPal API responses (access tokens, client tokens, "
"merchant status). Use this after changing credentials or if payments are "
"failing unexpectedly."
msgstr ""
"Kosongkan semua jawapan API PayPal yang dicache (token akses, token "
"pelanggan, status pedagang). Gunakan ini selepas menukar bukti kelayakan "
"atau jika pembayaran gagal tanpa diduga."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2062
msgid "3D Secure / SCA"
msgstr "3D Secure / SCA"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2064
msgid ""
"Control how your store handles 3D Secure (Strong Customer Authentication) "
"results for credit card payments. The recommended \"Smart\" mode blocks "
"only cards that fail their bank's authentication challenge — the typical "
"stolen-card signal behind fraud chargebacks — while letting all other "
"payments through, so legitimate sales are not affected."
msgstr ""
"Kawal cara kedai anda mengendalikan keputusan 3D Secure (Strong Customer "
"Authentication) untuk pembayaran kad kredit. Mod \"Pintar\" yang disyorkan "
"hanya menyekat kad yang gagal dalam cabaran pengesahan bank mereka — "
"isyarat kad curi yang biasa di sebalik caj balik penipuan — sambil "
"membenarkan semua pembayaran lain, supaya jualan yang sah tidak terjejas."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2067
msgid "Liability Shift Handling"
msgstr "Pengendalian Anjakan Liabiliti"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2070
msgid ""
"How to handle credit card payments based on their 3D Secure result. "
"\"Smart\" (recommended) only stops payments where the cardholder failed or "
"could not complete the bank authentication challenge, and lets the shopper "
"retry — this blocks most stolen-card fraud without declining legitimate "
"customers. \"Accept\" processes every payment (legacy behavior, least "
"protection). \"Review\" processes all payments but records the 3DS result "
"on the order for your own monitoring. \"Reject\" declines any payment that "
"does not receive a successful liability shift (strictest, but will decline "
"some legitimate cards that are not enrolled in 3D Secure)."
msgstr ""
"Cara mengendalikan pembayaran kad kredit berdasarkan hasil 3D Secure "
"mereka. \"Pintar\" (disyorkan) hanya menghentikan pembayaran apabila "
"pemegang kad gagal atau tidak dapat menyelesaikan cabaran pengesahan bank "
"dan membenarkan pembeli mencuba semula — ini menyekat kebanyakan penipuan "
"kad yang dicuri tanpa menolak pelanggan yang sah. \"Terima\" memproses "
"setiap pembayaran (tingkah laku warisan, perlindungan paling sedikit). "
"\"Semak\" memproses semua pembayaran tetapi merekodkan keputusan 3DS pada "
"pesanan untuk pemantauan anda sendiri. \"Tolak\" menolak sebarang "
"pembayaran yang tidak menerima peralihan liabiliti yang berjaya (paling "
"ketat, tetapi akan menolak beberapa kad sah yang tidak didaftarkan dalam 3D "
"Secure)."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2074
msgid ""
"Smart — Recommended: block only failed bank authentications, allow "
"everything else"
msgstr ""
"Pintar — Disyorkan: sekat sahaja pengesahan bank yang gagal, benarkan semua "
"yang lain"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2075
msgid "Accept — Process all payments (legacy, least protection)"
msgstr "Terima — Proses semua pembayaran (warisan, perlindungan paling sedikit)"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2076
msgid "Review — Process all payments but record the 3DS result for monitoring"
msgstr ""
"Semakan — Proses semua pembayaran tetapi rekod keputusan 3DS untuk "
"pemantauan"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2077
msgid ""
"Reject — Decline any payment without a successful liability shift "
"(strictest)"
msgstr ""
"Tolak — Tolak sebarang pembayaran tanpa peralihan liabiliti yang berjaya "
"(paling ketat)"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2081
msgid "3D Secure Logging"
msgstr "Pengelogan Selamat 3D"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2083
msgid "Log 3D Secure evaluation details"
msgstr "Log butiran penilaian 3D Secure"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2088
#. translators: %s is the path to the 3DS log file.
#, php-format
msgid "Log 3D Secure liability shift decisions inside %s"
msgstr "Log keputusan peralihan liabiliti selamat 3D dalam %s"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2093
msgid "Fraud Protection (reCAPTCHA v3)"
msgstr "Perlindungan Penipuan (reCAPTCHA v3)"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2095
msgid ""
"Protect your checkout from bots and card testing fraud using Google "
"reCAPTCHA v3. This is completely invisible to legitimate customers."
msgstr ""
"Lindungi pembayaran anda daripada penipuan ujian bot dan kad menggunakan "
"Google reCAPTCHA v3. Ini sama sekali tidak dapat dilihat oleh pelanggan "
"yang sah."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2098
msgid "Enable reCAPTCHA"
msgstr "Dayakan reCAPTCHA"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2100
msgid "Enable reCAPTCHA v3 fraud protection at checkout"
msgstr "Dayakan perlindungan penipuan reCAPTCHA v3 semasa pembayaran"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2103
msgid ""
"When enabled, checkout submissions are scored by Google reCAPTCHA v3. "
"Suspicious submissions are blocked before reaching PayPal. No impact on "
"legitimate customers."
msgstr ""
"Apabila didayakan, penyerahan pembayaran dijaringkan oleh Google reCAPTCHA "
"v3. Penyerahan yang mencurigakan disekat sebelum sampai ke PayPal. Tiada "
"kesan kepada pelanggan yang sah."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2106
msgid "reCAPTCHA Site Key"
msgstr "Kunci Tapak reCAPTCHA"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2110
#. translators: %s: URL to the Google reCAPTCHA admin console.
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Get your reCAPTCHA v3 keys from the <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Google "
"reCAPTCHA admin console</a>."
msgstr ""
"Dapatkan kunci reCAPTCHA v3 anda daripada konsol pentadbir <a href=\"%s\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google reCAPTCHA</a>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2116
msgid "reCAPTCHA Secret Key"
msgstr "Kunci Rahsia reCAPTCHA"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2118
msgid "Your reCAPTCHA v3 secret key. Keep this confidential."
msgstr "Kunci rahsia reCAPTCHA v3 anda. Simpan ini sulit."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2123
msgid "Score Threshold"
msgstr "Ambang Skor"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2126
msgid ""
"Submissions scoring below this value are blocked. Lower values are more "
"lenient (fewer false positives). Higher values are stricter (more fraud "
"blocked). Default 0.5 is recommended for most stores."
msgstr ""
"Penyerahan yang mendapat markah di bawah nilai ini disekat. Nilai yang "
"lebih rendah adalah lebih lembut (kurang positif palsu). Nilai yang lebih "
"tinggi adalah lebih ketat (lebih banyak penipuan disekat). Lalai 0.5 "
"disyorkan untuk kebanyakan kedai."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2130
msgid "0.1 — Very lenient"
msgstr "0.1 — Sangat berlembut"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2134
msgid "0.5 — Recommended"
msgstr "0.5 — Disyorkan"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2136
msgid "0.7 — Strict"
msgstr "0.7 - Ketat"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2138
msgid "0.9 — Very strict"
msgstr "0.9 — Sangat ketat"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2142
msgid "Skip for Logged-in Users"
msgstr "Langkau untuk Pengguna Log Masuk"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2144
msgid "Skip reCAPTCHA verification for logged-in users"
msgstr "Langkau pengesahan reCAPTCHA untuk pengguna log masuk"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2145
msgid ""
"When enabled, authenticated users bypass the reCAPTCHA check. This reduces "
"friction for returning customers."
msgstr ""
"Apabila didayakan, pengguna yang disahkan memintas semakan reCAPTCHA. Ini "
"mengurangkan geseran untuk pelanggan yang kembali."

